{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1432,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5059ebddd3b64db9af80759e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、いつもありがと…\r\nってビックリした～？\r\n…ま、半分は本音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfdacfe5800ac9a4da2963981cdffc281a3b32131708e1395cb7c97736b1e6cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:960ea813eb30877d72d50f88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海の家のかき氷、勝ったほうが\r\n買いに行くってことで～…\r\nじゃんけん、ぽん！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d0fc739ff43a8576bfb2b0049e0cc6bf9754c747d3147da3bb5e1b998cf19e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ae18f31ca96e75dfce3f54a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うわ、心臓の音やばぁ。\r\nトレちゃんのせいだぞ～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e6d64c8db13e4009a0ada06ebba526d9b67d504dea3ed900aabba3f948e4de0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9920f5472d3877422b3e7624",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うんうん、ワクワクしたよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "989ff65de317a48c6cd7c312f233919a04a974e6ebe99ed95ec52ec33a4e05cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d0090acfca466d312359e2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アプデかんりょ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86e3fbc63b440dee6c8ecfee7260908680f9dab345e9c6a9a2d6f4cfed43d3d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5acabbfed17407fc4a6912d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ニューモデルって感じじゃん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bea4714e725cb3f330c365027b5def5558d7b193d73cb7b52e67a81d96e649c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4313acbec8c0211aaba07d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どもども、トランセンドだよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "837c24cad759b323bd1067603624ba9f2a44122f7cace5d4138f8d65f81a5f2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fd2708128d0a1c831a15361",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新しいモノ、見たことないモノ！\r\nもっともっとゾクゾクしたい…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5d222afba815028b71d784b70a8a14aa8ac6c83e34de35650b3eba390005141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441cb10582a894701c6434d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冲啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea9e4fde89d6720f162282db99bf4c2a384ec91c4b23d4f3c57ca3c210fa51a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efcc34329105b071d4238953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老子变强了！就是因为老子这么\r\n锻炼啊！……嘛，虽然也有你那么\r\n一丁点功劳吧。……就一丁点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f31e2e5edeebc0b041a76eb6149238a4514db44c60d6452e140a0729df0b388",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab6213d0d69ccb3028a4e492",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f46af2a01ee48ca4e33b3a34cf3e048d1b6434845e6c847ad9862b65b9774ccf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c7a50a190569e0165f8b5a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcca0a999319539ad9640b8787eee70f6962f780c51356ce460851b0dce71db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53d0fc82afc3a7d19f438256",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你这家伙……和其他大人相比，\r\n大概有点……不一样吧。\r\n……切，我就随口一说！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1625378fb0f6adc4abc849f58d645ef0bac17349ab2728fcd4c1487090ab9b8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51309f64771d7c8f2c98b582",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那些带过路的新生后辈……竟然到处\r\n传我温柔又善良什么的……\r\n这全是你的错，知道吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbf10223197cf089c865ded112cb161a3d8bf5087f8148288570af25b29708ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a44c976dc5905b5af423771f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做了年夜饭结果被吓了一跳……\r\n亲手做那种东西很稀奇吗？\r\n和老妈一起做不是理所当然的吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce13ee620d690aa26cb74559f6a74fffda6ea30b7d5af3eb983bc4360e94bf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:742ca36c297ad1c82deef6f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年都会给家里寄巧克力的。\r\n所以今年也是——……\r\n老爸那份是附带的！没办法才给他的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f71557d0c6105c26de428fadbe2a5634aed8d347f35bcc6892685b428b8b0c00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e3968d57f2800665eef074d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，想吃巧克力蛋糕吗……？\r\n……事先说明我只是做多了！\r\n顺便分你点而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0580f263efec98e94c7fb4f3533e138c08b75a54872fa91782a81e70ce27dbdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:363aec7564dabeeee2ab0ce9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕什么的无聊死了！才没写什么\r\n短册呢，也没写……祝家人健康\r\n之类的……这种事根本不用特意写！——……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0b8b605f9ba13d24c5e110d9e75602ac8344965f1df34a3a87f3d16ea4f37de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95315c856fd8b2126b293179",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被飞鹰说了什么“Live or Treat”。\r\n给了她点心结果她垂头丧气的……\r\nLive啊……作为观众看的话倒是还行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a896cbbb550d6c5b04dce319cdf7f0b20f831725b3f50113a34fe3855adb95a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbbf464c8e28488415ff31a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发现了一家装饰得很带劲的\r\n圣诞灯光。把自己家也搞得\r\n闪亮亮的，超酷的吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d1ae5d9236f44917da4187be0c14054c4e354353abb659d0f39196200d41cc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2c0430cc175744dc6bfd6d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，你这家伙……相信圣诞老人\r\n到几岁啊？——啊，我？我一下就\r\n看穿那是老爸了！真的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be1b90178d9f0d78fa8dce4aa9673d6f9a5524f083e3271884471935fdd1e4f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:500946e55eea1945e5f5beda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哟西！",
      "source_fingerprint": "713cd60f0fe94d4c5199336563ad9145f80dd85c5dab0f4e7bf75c5eb6c14601",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7954ed2746c0b49c3c38ade8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大扫除？还在说那种事吗。\r\n哈！！\r\n老子早就爆速干完了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c85533bf1ade3343e04af274e6775ec425c102044d8d32630722d0cf3cfc9a09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebe9f74f3bfd8e0a6114664b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈？你今天生日！？\r\n这种事早点说啊，那种事情！\r\n我都还没准备好呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "842a52b6e077e91f00d43414d4ba24004a732b4a324c8b8e479e9c96a56c9032",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10679f392642cdd9bbad82cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，看到训练员室的东西了吗。\r\n……那个便当！是给你的慰问品啦混蛋！\r\n你生日对吧，有意见吗啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "af7ad8eff408dfa05b388670351f77376b9b57c58990c9aa80d177f648e60e54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cf594dd0b21808e76b7db6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吹灭生日蛋糕的\r\n蜡烛，我可是专业的。\r\n不管几根都能一口气吹灭！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b8dd4aa8b532a88e43a4d4dcd89a94ce6fe88a3dd131a19e4fdf40145e5fa55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2283d516e3317e5463ffb67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么你这家伙在那高兴啊。\r\n过生日的可是老子。\r\n……真是个，让人受不了的家伙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "da626a991528317fbac1de090b97e086deca6136b1ea96949379d339263293e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5b9b44c910f8d5bf85146ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，来公告了。\r\n赶紧去确认一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8d96e8b1788604582bd1af66818c4816004c548f4dc235c13be8d65d37ce62f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04ec5642c026d16c1e882df5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物。早点去领了比较好吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbe51df7f407d059da26f87c43b35868992007f6ba898a948144d9145ed8e771",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2922bdc1112600263a853333",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞，任务完成！\r\n轻轻松松！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a86f55617d3bca99861e453939f79bdd042f33a94c732d0f6a17150c1f29ab4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76abfee01fa3775716f3602a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有活动啊……！\r\n嘿嘿，我要疯狂爆肝\r\n拿第一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c459a36282c3838c68437a82e26bc475d0b1b7594eaf227649da4a8db3e85810",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d9b4f7654693b8b8af15d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噢啦噢啦！这就去活动里\r\n把全员甩在身后！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75064529bf05c79b248c6ebaf15759396257949d1d5a57482ac9a54ac75b14b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72300f2162d224d0701cc3aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次绝对要把你干碎！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1649b924c771f5618a42b271045a0a09bca341b4cbdee2ac9007ecf133ed6b4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f22b8b9d486a59e4eaefeab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干得不错嘛，\r\n名鉴等级提升了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efd41d002283b1b0c674b7ee333f6eebabff5b991fe38fda19767fa1b1bc975c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0766a9c05ff9b4f232dd7702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说起强大的颜色那就是黑色了吧！\r\n又酷又强又独立的家伙，就是要\r\n穿一身帅气的黑色才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b244a40229031069727d6db117787c6082a68a62ff0a82145cb1c13b41a71d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:388eb48f87196a9de80fcda5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊——……声音还是很沙哑……。\r\n跟太阳神她们的卡拉OK耐力赛唱过头了，\r\n太激烈了……可恶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90611639b21d504a1797b362a9ff5aed4bb6bec1634a729b441ed16999bc1d5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca45b7e33cdfdbf9620707ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "车站前的平价商店，饰品角\r\n真的很火热啊～。黑金的\r\n颈圈，果然还是想要啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d24655383418e60d36abac1fe1a43e0c1177b5441d9f7986cfab515964c784d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba4b73254eaffae77192f67d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打得挺精彩嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5a7ebff1c4caaf77eeab28d55320add370f9bf17240fdc1831bc436bd2f0e65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d88e13ac046591d5a0e41b8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最强的，就是我们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa86c982b2e6ea73c1f552051388e75f9baa71e4bdf0ec54406479cb1a8b66c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b27428bf4ea3b173bde21636",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次绝对要把你干碎！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1649b924c771f5618a42b271045a0a09bca341b4cbdee2ac9007ecf133ed6b4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5eb293a913c8a00c3392f3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打得挺精彩嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5a7ebff1c4caaf77eeab28d55320add370f9bf17240fdc1831bc436bd2f0e65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3ce03b03388594696d4c69f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样，吓尿了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62454aa290bc6f9c0a3c9e9bc85cad4df8d3c04ece6a4d9d6d81d9c145bc6111",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7b1eec40d5245b795f2b829",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给他们点颜色看看，你们几个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d5fddf92a3ac0658b42a2231a8a16fac1e28c8aea6f6fc003c2f8ab2ce5e332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:271ac055ce02254f6588275f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5e0c651f5842e0d63e62db8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练……？\r\n不管什么都尽管来啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa4acad374710adea01a6b3d943390bf2230087264b7b319907f1db7a1ebd4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ba6547fb8bab0115733b314",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学院的历史啊。\r\n那种东西，老子来改写给你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a2cedaf2e0c7d53119c9072c5791b606635238867ed7fc1963546f83bbc2603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c1de328e365c926710ca798",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛啊！\r\n让你见识一下什么叫最强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b36a2fb9ed08afa671ee0b149c56c0f3caae0a88c4abd12666aba97dd79e3aeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53d001785b632f9168b69d15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘，Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb83cf4ef414ba1498ca22eb71c89743df595040a09f9d503fb2e9db9beca0d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fb904328a9a849429ebc597",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总感觉，整个人都燃起来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f5f04d74f08145fdc5706488e68c26b5796e8dfabcf575b1a03011580c353ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa5195dae55f87018592a94d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别怂啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af178074a4761518a2eb14b840c2c2a5d98435542d0bd6b11d741693573b3588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b483156e63897cd9e604d099",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把你干碎！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aec8112e291124a7f7300158a1f014f3429ae4bbc447b296b93325caff10ca1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1243"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce33b12e83a8c51b1de59d0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "撞烂他们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fdc56c886c2171b43112b887a8309d06614b9d6b266ba485f0710bc29b5ea85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1244"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cb283de77b7f1d38004c553",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说是登录奖励哦。\r\n喂，赶紧给老子领了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d63a68bfc43177a99611fff27c63b557ed66f1dcba3f14832ab8d50077c8704",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eb0df76267cf846377d0377",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把那帮家伙连根拔起，噢啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bf3962ff439d22526eb1f77083f57022fc979a35ca9a200fd8f818215c82cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:275ff7f672a54e221601e04c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61001b03d3bd62444b0e3108412891d24ae8c73521b01502f1ef914bf0928b70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90b440dde3dd95d5cd32ce2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b6ae424ee4b401419c35c536777fe7fbc81ed6c912a347267fb4c85ca3171a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19ca0f9209bb38ea2ba4cbd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，大丰收大丰收！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66abab6121dfe7685a899caa63e44bc11e2bed0a96e64c00bdeda3ac4ae52187",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6332a1b78deb9e777697060",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，也就这种程度吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36af851c319bc2e198e2be7c81435e21e337db71a388f1a61399aa6f5b78020c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4413a87bd6329842cd983ca4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝对要复仇！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0734239956e82ec5f335ec1d2353a5ade734ae9861a9ec9a0260c8129474a56e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86f5a8b310df8bfc49549640",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，大丰收大丰收！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66abab6121dfe7685a899caa63e44bc11e2bed0a96e64c00bdeda3ac4ae52187",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1308a62d48ff0ac7962835bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，也就这种程度吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36af851c319bc2e198e2be7c81435e21e337db71a388f1a61399aa6f5b78020c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7ab736c87faad7e02397d48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给老子撞碎它！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d144ab520a4b92fe546a348e34f084d6af30f6a8a9833c870aa8a94bcf25221",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:860e92159d05b1971dd8a94b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还是大的比较好吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c4d87b4f15d7e50f68322e34db9fe8e41a2d74c9136b4221095496159143a57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:614408ce4d0f92dcf99228c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b44f0ced1c9eefcb4c785ebf99fa75fa7a9b475fd90ec6fdc1c54f86243188ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:324b5dbcca6c36d52ba29305",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2deba7ca30c98238317c64bb01282f7578b945b19432461c4536c6681ac4b8ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84f7993cbb8f40e3779d91cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞，拿下了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1023fec6b099de3a2279889bd6116e0c1619b7cd5a159c25221288f876b2e5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862ef04b6d2d18643c3c09b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噢啦噢啦噢啦噢啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1517060d28e8750c9ab72906d8295015aa757d172662bd85dc8c03da7236e9ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f52bbd133c80628769a694e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，逃走了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae89a92e764ecc9b9fc8d773d77e76d80366f7ece1e4d14d8cf0a014d85190be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc21d1fa97639c7fa0af5251",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fffa89d48f387e8f26e4be734fffbb101d7c11ea4da29970e28fa7eb3d00c047",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da872a2abd675ea05737b840",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，别发呆啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26250f9f8862e4d8cf85232228621bebd3bc79512268a60d5324266ff38dc3ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40abc6dc4e6690dc368c05dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么啊——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b533ff310f596856e1c4350b64ab278495a06633fae67143fd92ed7bbc8bc61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e0e74f0cea4ce4a96e037f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔唔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80cf22f59621131d9329909005bacc3183bd7be2eab93c85eb0ca243074110ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a66e8ed9125dd3b24bf96b80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天能领的是这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1eb8b293dd01a68d9de92c085cc2ca8cf2de7c62c8de78c633129c55240a072",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:927f0e21ac768689b77f59b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼————……。\r\n——啊！？这不是因为我虚弱了！\r\n老子游刃有余着呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d014f5061c1c423feada149070f2d7250970efebb72dd965cd3893fd86a2255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9be7bda5b8dafa0b1ea0168e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，你该不会打算今天也要训练吧！\r\n给我稍微休息一下啊，你个大、大、大笨蛋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f2e9aa265eda0117697e03f2d664993b67f84c6acbe4f9962b310755f11dc63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7961e605c94e4670508572db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我要拼命锻炼！\r\n把最硬核的菜单拿出来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0600675976099eeda45993819afde81af5c1f5c44afbff87c79e987174eb8cd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3ecf8922c314c24b398364c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噢啦噢啦！不管什么都来吧！\r\n无论你出什么任务，我都会\r\n轻轻松松地搞定！",
      "source_fingerprint": "364e706073cc81ec5f1e12483f4ecb1a0d71f1bb9f110592fb5b5e0c015fe024",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36ace876f40a49b9521f99c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞，先来第一把！\r\n给他们点颜色看看，\r\n吓死周围那帮家伙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e640d0b1c491b8e3f28aa705a30928cbc4747acd0684a91eda732ba6061bad5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4481a17cc1f0beca813dea50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，今天的我可是超强的哦？\r\n要疯狂刷新个人纪录！\r\n不管是斜坡冲刺还是捏爆铁球！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08a784f48798044eb7d25921d812f1f63d0e0d892adaa687bb40fc223f9cfff3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9fa74c4a2e4387c703f11a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，今天先练什么。\r\n要不要先开个作战会议？昂？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bb15de2b343a9826f3fca070713c1271affc71a5d73fac9a8b11fff6a559928",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "20006"
      ]
    }
  ]
